Quest 1201 "Manufacture Clothing"
    Journal "Bring an Apple of Moradon from worms to manufacture a blanket"
    Collect 2 of 810418000

Requires player level >= 1

Rewards
    Give 250 experience
    Give 2000 coins

On available
    Say "Master! Mr. Potrang's looking for you."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Good to see you. There are people who can't even move because of what Draki has done. Could you please help them out?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "We need blankets and something that they can use to wash their body, but we need to eat something first. Could you get us some Apple of Moradon? Apples of Moradon can be obtained from worms."

